  "snippet": "#​808 — October 27, 2026 Read on the Web JavaScript Weekly TanStack AI 1.0: The Vendor-Neutral AI Toolkit Goes Stable — TanStack's framework-agnostic AI toolkit reaches 1.0, with stable APIs for chat, tools and media, pl...",
